[about]
Title=4 - Find Your Way in a Long Document
Intro=One want: a place in a long report, found now and found again tomorrow. Finding a word, jumping to a line, setting a bookmark and returning to it, and hearing how big the document is. This walk assumes walk three.
Setup=A long document is open in EdSharp.
Homework=Find a word in a document of your own, bookmark the place, go to the top, and come back.

[step]

Say=The want: a place in a long report, found again tomorrow. Control plus F, Forward Find, asks for the text and remembers your last answers.
Key=Control+F
Hear=Forward Find dialog, Find: edit combo

[step]

Say=budget, and Enter. The cursor lands on the first match, and the line is read.
Key=Enter
Hear=The budget for the second quarter is attached.

[step]

Say=F3 finds the next; Shift plus F3 the previous. A find that reaches the end says so and stops.
Key=F3
Hear=Budget notes follow in the appendix.

[step]

Say=Control plus J, Jump to Line, takes a number: a line, or a line and a column.
Key=Control+J
Hear=Jump to Line dialog, Line: edit

[step]

Say=120, and Enter.
Key=Enter
Hear=Section four. Staffing.

[step]

Say=Control plus K, Set Bookmark, marks the place; EdSharp says how far down the document it is.
Key=Control+K
Hear=Bookmark at percent 40

[step]

Say=Move away -- Control plus Home to the top -- then Alt plus K, Go to Bookmark, brings you back. Bookmarks are kept with the file, so tomorrow's Alt plus K lands here too.
Key=Alt+K
Hear=Section four. Staffing.

[step]

Say=Alt plus Y, Say Yield, says the size of what you are in: characters, words and lines, for all the text or the selection.
Key=Alt+Y
Hear=14,205 characters, 2,310 words, 188 lines

[step]

Say=Control plus R, Replace, is Find's sibling: the text to find, the text to put in its place, in all the document or in the selection. Each replacement is counted and the count is said.
Key=Control+R
Hear=Replace dialog, Find: edit combo

[step]

Say=Escape. For a pattern rather than a word -- every number, every line that begins with a dash -- Control plus F3 finds with a regular expression, and Control plus Shift plus R replaces with one. The expressions are the dot NET kind, and the guide has a page on them.
Key=Escape
Hear=Section four. Staffing.

[step]

Say=The document's shape is a set of keys too. Control plus Down Arrow is the next paragraph; Alt plus Right Arrow the next chunk, read as you land on it; Control plus Right Arrow the next word.
Key=
Hear=

[step]

Say=Alt plus A, Say Address, is the anchor for all of this: line, column and percent, at any moment, so you know where a find landed you before you start to type.
Key=Alt+A
Hear=Line 120, column 1, 64 percent

[step]

Say=Alt plus Shift plus F, File Find, searches not this document but a folder of files for a string, and opens the one you pick from the list -- for the day the place you want is in some other file.
Key=Alt+Shift+F
Hear=File Find dialog, Find: edit combo

[step]

Say=Escape.
Key=Escape
Hear=Section four. Staffing.

[step]

Say=Control plus Home goes to the very top of the document, and Control plus End to the very bottom; Alt plus A then says where you landed.
Key=Control+End
Hear=Thank you for reading.
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=A bookmark stays with the file, so a long report can be left and picked up again tomorrow, at the same place, with Alt plus K.
Key=Alt+K
Hear=Section four. Staffing.
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=And a find's last answers are remembered too: Control plus F offers budget again, so the next search for it is one key.
Key=Control+F
Hear=Forward Find dialog, Find: edit combo, budget
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Escape.
Key=Escape
Hear=Section four. Staffing.

[step]

Say=What this walk taught. I say the key; the reader says what it does.
Key=
Hear=

[step]

Say=Control plus F.
Key=
Hear=Forward Find

[step]

Say=Control plus J.
Key=
Hear=Jump to Line

[step]

Say=Control plus K.
Key=
Hear=Set Bookmark

[step]

Say=Alt plus K.
Key=
Hear=Go to Bookmark
